.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt CAT 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm cat
.Nd concatenate files to the console
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility writes each
.Ar file
to the console in order.
There is no standard input in this milestone; a lone
.Sq -
is treated as a file name and fails to open.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr cp 1 ,
.Xr ls 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
